// PARAM: --analysis interval --solver warrow-per-origin --context call-string --context-depth 1
// warrow-per-origin under a call-string context. Depth 1 keeps only the
// innermost call site, so both activations of q -- contexts [main:q(1)] and
// [main:q(2)] -- enter p at the single context [q:p(m)]. That one
// FunctionEntry seed is written from two origins, [1,1] and [2,2].
// Widening per origin keeps each contribution exact and joins afterwards,
// so the entry slot reads [1,2] and n < 10 is decided.
//
// The same program under --solver warrow is the paired known-imprecision
// case (04-warrow_call_string_joins_before_widening.vimp). Context-free
// sibling: 06-warrow_per_origin_keeps_bound.vimp.
void p(n) {
  __voblint_check(n < 10) // PROVED
}
void q(m) {
  p(m)
}
void main() {
  q(1);
  q(2)
}
